# Capital-Agents Environment Configuration (.env)

# All services below offer 100% FREE tiers with zero cost.
# The application is designed to operate completely within their free tiers.


# 1. Alpaca Markets (OHLCV Quotes and News Streams)
# Free signup: https://alpaca.markets
ALPACA_API_KEY=your_alpaca_key_here
ALPACA_API_SECRET=your_alpaca_secret_here

# 2. Federal Reserve Economic Data (FRED)
# Free signup: https://fred.stlouisfed.org/
FRED_API_KEY=your_fred_key_here

# 3. Finnhub (Financial Data & Market News)
# Free signup: https://finnhub.io
FINNHUB_API_KEY=your_finnhub_key_here

# 4. OpenRouter (Cloud LLM API - Optional if running llama.cpp locally)
# Free signup & free models: https://openrouter.ai
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_key_here

# 5. Massive / Polygon API Key (Optional - ONLY needed for exec/mass_downloader.py)
# Free signup: https://polygon.io
MASSIVE_API_KEY=your_massive_polygon_key_here
